flowchart TB
    Client[Frontend / API client] --> Gateway[FastAPI validation]
    Gateway --> Cache{Cache mode}
    Cache -->|fresh hit| Response[Investigation response]
    Cache -->|miss, refresh, or bypass| Budget[Provider call budget]
    Budget --> Orchestrator[Investigation orchestrator]

    Orchestrator --> Discovery[Public profile URL probes]
    Discovery --> SocialSelect[Primary first; max 4 paid social platforms]

    subgraph Social[Capability-routed social collection]
        Instagram[Instagram -> existing Apify Actors]
        Twitter[X/Twitter -> existing Apify Actor]
        LinkedIn[LinkedIn -> Bright Data]
        Facebook[Facebook -> existing Apify Actors]
        Reddit[Reddit -> existing Apify Actor]
        TikTok[TikTok -> configured Apify Actor]
        Telegram[Telegram -> existing public / MTProto collectors]
    end

    SocialSelect --> Instagram
    SocialSelect --> Twitter
    SocialSelect --> LinkedIn
    SocialSelect --> Facebook
    SocialSelect --> Reddit
    SocialSelect --> TikTok
    SocialSelect --> Telegram

    subgraph Specialist[Explicit specialist capabilities]
        Search[Google search -> SerpAPI only]
        Web[Web scrape -> Bright Data]
        Extract[Structured extract -> Firecrawl]
        GitHub[GitHub -> GitHub REST API]
        Email[Email -> Hunter.io]
        Phone[Phone -> Twilio Lookup]
    end

    Orchestrator --> Search
    Orchestrator --> Web
    Orchestrator --> Extract
    Orchestrator --> GitHub
    Orchestrator --> Email
    Orchestrator --> Phone

    Social --> Normalize[Normalize and preserve provenance]
    Specialist --> Normalize
    Normalize --> Correlate[Correlation / risk / reporting]
    Correlate --> History[(Investigation history)]
    Correlate --> StoreCache[(In-process TTL/LRU cache)]
    Correlate --> Response

    NoFallback[No automatic cross-provider fallback] -. policy .-> Social
    NoFallback -. policy .-> Specialist
